{"kind":"turn","turn":0,"clockMin":0,"child":null,"move":"greet","ttfa":1128,"words":21,"teacher":"Hi Riya, I’m Arjun, your AI teacher. Today we’ll play with comparing fractions. First, do you like cats or drawing more?","status":"completed","audioMs":7950,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":907,"inText":907,"inAudio":0,"cached":0,"cachedText":0,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":245,"outText":86,"outAudio":159}
{"kind":"turn","turn":1,"clockMin":0.24,"child":"Mujhe cats zyada pasand hain, mere Chiku jaisi!","childMs":4000,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"hook","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1077,"held":2,"heldAudio":2,"ttfa":1360,"words":28,"teacher":"Riya, imagine two bowls for cats: one bowl is 1 by 2 full, the other is 1 by 3. Which will Chiku choose? Then you will teach Bittu.","status":"completed","audioMs":10000,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1003,"inText":963,"inAudio":40,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":296,"outText":96,"outAudio":200}
{"kind":"turn","turn":2,"clockMin":0.57,"child":"Chiku 1/3 wala choose karega, kyunki 3 bada hai 2 se!","childMs":5950,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"explain","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1084,"held":3,"heldAudio":3,"ttfa":1628,"words":25,"teacher":"Riya, the step broke where you compared denominators. With the same numerator, smaller denominator means a bigger piece. So which is bigger: one-half or one-third?","status":"completed","audioMs":10850,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1151,"inText":1052,"inAudio":99,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":318,"outText":101,"outAudio":217}
{"kind":"turn","turn":3,"clockMin":0.93,"child":"Bhaiya, meri ek billi hai, uska naam Chiku hai. Woh abhi meri copy pe baithi hai.","childMs":6650,"probe":"fact","afterBarge":false,"move":"worked_example","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1071,"held":4,"heldAudio":4,"ttfa":3564,"words":17,"teacher":"Riya, 4/5 ko common denominator 30 par badal: 24/30. Ab 25/30 aur 24/30 me kaun bada? bolo.","status":"completed","audioMs":10100,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1286,"inText":1121,"inAudio":165,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":532,"outText":330,"outAudio":202}
{"kind":"turn","turn":4,"clockMin":1.29,"child":"25/30 bada hai, kyunki 25, 24 se bada hai.","childMs":5900,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"worked_example","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1088,"held":5,"heldAudio":5,"ttfa":1802,"words":23,"teacher":"Bilkul, tumne sahi step pakda. Ab agla sawaal: Kya zyada hai: cake ka 2/9 ya usi cake ka 2/5? Choose: 2/9, ya 2/5.","status":"completed","audioMs":12700,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1412,"inText":1188,"inAudio":224,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":399,"outText":145,"outAudio":254}
{"kind":"turn","turn":5,"clockMin":1.65,"child":"2/5 zyada hai, kyunki denominator chhota hai.","childMs":4450,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"probe","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1271,"held":6,"heldAudio":6,"ttfa":2007,"words":19,"teacher":"Sahi choice. Riya, is cake ke equal parts ko soch kar, tumhe kaise pata chala ki 2/5 zyada hai?","status":"completed","audioMs":6500,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1670,"inText":1402,"inAudio":268,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":279,"outText":149,"outAudio":130}
{"kind":"turn","turn":6,"clockMin":1.91,"child":"Paanch tukde bade hote hain, isliye 2/5 zyada hai.","childMs":5000,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"repair","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1234,"held":7,"heldAudio":7,"ttfa":1666,"words":20,"teacher":"Riya, I didn’t catch that clearly. Can you say it once more, or just tap the choice: 2/9 or 2/5?","status":"completed","audioMs":7350,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1744,"inText":1426,"inAudio":318,"cached":576,"cachedText":576,"cachedAudio":0,"outTok":254,"outText":107,"outAudio":147}
